# T380 diagnostic builds only. Package under /system/etc/init, so the write
# executes in init (which already has sysfs_wake_lock and BLOCK_SUSPEND access).
# lpm_levels.sleep_disabled only limits cpuidle, not Android system suspend.
# Keep this explicit lock until wake and inhibit retention are validated.
# Release this exact name manually only for a coordinator-controlled test.
on init && property:ro.debuggable=1
    write /sys/power/wake_lock t380-development-awake
